#: ../../../api/v3.rst:51
msgid "Rate limiting"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../api/v3.rst:53
msgid ""
"The API limits unauthenticated requests to 5 per minute and authenticated "
"requests to 60 per minute."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../api/v3.rst:57
msgid ""
"Authenticating your API requests with a :ref:`token <api/v3:Token>` also "
"bypasses most other rate limiting, including network-level blocks that may "
"affect automated scripts accessing Read the Docs from cloud providers or CI "
"environments. If your script is getting ``403 Forbidden`` responses, adding "
"an ``Authorization: Token <your-access-token>`` header is the recommended "
"solution."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../api/v3.rst:62
msgid "Pagination"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../api/v3.rst:64
msgid ""
"All endpoints that return a list of objects are paginated. By default, 10 "
"objects are returned per page, but you can change this using the ``limit`` "
"query parameter. The response includes a ``count``, ``next``, and "
"``previous`` attributes to navigate between pages."
msgstr ""

